{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. A suitcase is positioned on the right side of the layout. To the left of the suitcase, there is a pair of pliers. A pen is located directly below the pliers, and a spoon is placed below the pen. To the left of the spoon sits a donut. Furthermore, for every set of keys in the scene, it is located on the left side of the image and is strictly smaller than the donut.",
